@startuml UC-02: Quản lý hồ sơ nhân viên

actor "Admin" as Admin
participant "Frontend" as FE
participant "API Gateway" as GW
participant "User Service" as US
database "PostgreSQL" as DB

Admin -> FE: Truy cập trang tạo nhân viên
FE -> FE: Load form template
FE --> Admin: Hiển thị form điền thông tin

Admin -> FE: Điền thông tin nhân viên\n(firstName, lastName, email, phone)
Admin -> FE: Chọn department và position
FE -> FE: Validate client-side\n(email format, required fields)
FE -> GW: POST /api/employee\n+ employee data + JWT token
activate GW

GW -> GW: Extract JWT token
GW -> GW: Validate token format
GW -> US: Forward request to User Service
activate US

US -> US: Validate dữ liệu đầu vào\n(email format, phone format)
US -> US: Check email uniqueness
US -> DB: SELECT COUNT(*) WHERE email = ?
activate DB
DB --> US: Email count result
deactivate DB

alt Email already exists
    US --> GW: 400 Bad Request\n+ "Email đã tồn tại"
    GW --> FE: Error response
    FE --> Admin: Hiển thị lỗi email trùng lặp
else Email is unique
    US -> DB: INSERT INTO employee\n(firstName, lastName, email, phone, departmentId, positionId)
    activate DB
    DB --> US: Employee created with ID
    deactivate DB
    
    US -> US: Generate employee code\n(EMP + timestamp)
    US -> DB: UPDATE employee SET employeeCode = ?
    activate DB
    DB --> US: Update successful
    deactivate DB
    
    US --> GW: 201 Created\n+ employee data + employeeCode
    deactivate US
    
    GW --> FE: Success response
    deactivate GW
    
    FE --> Admin: Hiển thị thông báo thành công\n+ Employee ID + Employee Code
end

@enduml
